        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linker Vibe</strong> is a clean, modern take on classic Numberlink puzzles.<br>Connect matching tiles, draw paths across the grid, and fill every space without crossing lines. Easy to learn, satisfying to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes <strong>800 puzzles</strong> across multiple grid sizes and difficulty levels. Each theme brings its own colors and atmosphere, giving every set of puzzles a distinct mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is calm and focused. No timers. No pressure. Just smooth line-drawing, clear logic, and the joy of completing each board.</p>",
